<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SLIDE 03 — PROBLEM STATEMENT
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="slide bg-dots" id="slide-3" style="background-color:#030712;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 60px;overflow:hidden;">
    <div class="fade-up" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#ef4444;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;">Section 01</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,48px);font-weight:900;margin-top:4px;">Pakistan's <span class="text-rose-400">Food Waste Crisis</span></h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1">A critical national dilemma between abundance and acute hunger</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;width:100%;max-width:1100px;">
        <div class="glass feature-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-rose-500/30 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="text-5xl mb-3">🗑️</div>
            <div class="text-4xl font-black text-rose-400 mb-2">36 Million</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Tons of Food Wasted</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Nearly 36% of all food cooked & grown in Pakistan ends up in garbage dumps every year.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass feature-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-amber-500/30 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="text-5xl mb-3">💔</div>
            <div class="text-4xl font-black text-amber-400 mb-2">2.5+ Crore</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">People Sleep Hungry</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Over 25 million people suffer from severe malnutrition & daily hunger across urban & rural areas.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass feature-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-purple-500/30 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="text-5xl mb-3">🏨</div>
            <div class="text-4xl font-black text-purple-400 mb-2">70%</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Restaurant Leftovers</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Marriage halls & commercial diners discard safe, high-grade edible food due to no channel.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 glass px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl max-w-4xl text-center border-l-4 border-rose-500">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-rose-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">The Missing Link:</span>
            Restaurants have surplus food but lack logistics. Charities need food daily but have no real-time visibility. 
            <strong class="text-white">ShareMeal was built to permanently close this communication & distribution void.</strong>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SLIDE 04 — SOLUTION OVERVIEW
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="slide bg-grid" id="slide-4" style="background-color:#020617;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 60px;overflow:hidden;">
